These modules port the network backbones, post-hoc refiners, in-sampler guidance and
sequence-pair annealer of the following works so they run under the Trinity interface.
Each module names its source repository and file.

* MacroDiff+ — https://github.com/jhy00n/MacroDiff-plus — MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2026 MacroDiff+ Authors.
* BBOPlace-Bench — https://github.com/lamda-bbo/BBOPlace-Bench — MIT License (as stated in
  its README).
* ChipDiffusion — https://github.com/vint-1/chipdiffusion — no license declared upstream.
* DiffPlace — https://github.com/HySonLab/DiffPlace — no license declared upstream.
* FlowPlace — https://github.com/lamda-bbo/flowplace — no license declared upstream.
